<title>JAPAN: Senshu Bank says to announce earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Senshu Bank says to announce earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osaka-based regional bank Senshu Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that it would hold a news conference at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT) on an earnings revision and a change in its dividend.</p>
</text>
